### Elo Vet - Coleção de requisições (HTTP Client)

# Instruções:
# 1) Use o HTTP Client do IntelliJ (abrir este arquivo e executar blocos) ou execute via curl substituindo as variáveis.
# 2) Faça o registro/login para obter os tokens JWT e preencha as variáveis `ADMIN_TOKEN` e `USER_TOKEN` abaixo.

@ADMIN_TOKEN =
@USER_TOKEN =

### Autenticação — Registro e Login

### Registrar Admin (veterinário/proxy)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin1",
  "password": "adminpass",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Login Admin (pegar token em campo token)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin1",
  "password": "adminpass"
}

### Registrar Tutor (USER)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "tutor1",
  "password": "tutorpass",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Login Tutor
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "tutor1",
  "password": "tutorpass"
}

### CRUD de Pet

### Listar pets
GET http://localhost:8080/pet
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Obter pet por id
GET http://localhost:8080/pet/{{PET_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Criar pet (ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/pet
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

{
  "nome": "Rex"
}

### Atualizar pet (ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8080/pet/{{PET_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

{
  "nome": "Rex Jr"
}

### Deletar pet (ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/pet/{{PET_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### CRUD de Veterinário

### Listar veterinários
GET http://localhost:8080/veterinary
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Obter veterinário por id
GET http://localhost:8080/veterinary/{{VET_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Criar veterinário (ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/veterinary
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

{
  "nome": "Dra. Ana Silva",
  "crmv": 1001
}

### Atualizar veterinário (ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8080/veterinary/{{VET_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

{
  "nome": "Dra. Ana S.",
  "crmv": 1001
}

### Deletar veterinário (ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/veterinary/{{VET_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Fluxo Care (Planos de cuidados)

### Criar care plan (HANDOFF) como ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/veterinaries/{{VET_ID}}/care-plans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

{
  "petId": {{PET_ID}},
  "petOwnerId": {{USER_ID}},
  "notes": "Plano de cuidados simplificado",
  "items": [
    { "title": "Dar medicação X", "description": "2x ao dia", "dueDate": "2030-01-01" },
    { "title": "Retorno em 7 dias", "description": "Avaliação clínica", "dueDate": "2030-01-08" }
  ]
}

### Listar care plans para um usuário (tutor)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{USER_ID}}/care-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

### Marcar item do care plan (tutor)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/care-plans/{{CARE_PLAN_ID}}/items/{{ITEM_ID}}/mark
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "status": "DONE",
  "note": "Medicação administrada"
}

### Processar reminders (endpoint administrativo manual)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/process-reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Observações
# - Substitua as variáveis {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}, {{USER_TOKEN}}, {{PET_ID}}, {{VET_ID}}, {{USER_ID}}, {{CARE_PLAN_ID}}, {{ITEM_ID}} pelos valores reais retornados pela API.
# - O `api.http` é um ponto de partida; ajuste datas e IDs conforme necessário.

